  affiliation: "Johannes Kepler University, Institute for Integrated Circuits and Quantum Computing"
title: "IHP__MPC9724: a mixed-signal test chip on the ihp-sg13cmos5l Open-PDK with the DSADC1 digital back end and a first-order delta-sigma modulator."
abstract: "Tapeout repository of the MPC9724 chip on IHP SG13CMOS5L: a 1.3 x 1.3 mm die in a QFN24 package. It carries dsa1_dig, the 128x decimation filter with an SPI slave and the configuration register file, hardened with LibreLane on the EZ130 8T standard cells, and dsm2_core, a first-order discrete-time delta-sigma modulator on its own VDDA segment of the pad ring."
keywords:
  - IHP SG13CMOS5L
  - delta-sigma ADC
  - decimation filter
  - open-source silicon
  - LibreLane
